      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَوْشِىٌّ</span></b>  A <i>poor</i> man <i>having a numerous family</i>
or <i>household:</i> (S, K:) or <i>having a family</i> or
<i>household:</i> (Aboo-Sa'eed:) and one <i>of the baser
